WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.235
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind following hyperlinks.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.831
Web browser: opens websites and web pages. Address bar: shows or accepts a website

00:00:11.831 --> 00:00:12.239
address.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:19.024
Home page: is the main starting page of a website. Hyperlink: opens another page or

00:00:19.024 --> 00:00:23.357
resource when selected. Back button: returns to a previously visited page.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.885
Use an imaginary example or a teacher-approved offline screenshot. Discuss when to

00:00:28.885 --> 00:00:34.741
use web browser and address bar. Never enter a real password or share private details

00:00:34.741 --> 00:00:35.912
in this activity.
